---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import BookingWidget from '../../components/BookingWidget.astro';
import { flagship as p } from '../../data/properties/index.mjs';
const img = (f, s = '') => `${p.images.dir}/${f}${s ? `-${s}w` : ''}.webp`;
const hero = p.images.gallery[0];
---
<Base locale="en" pageKey="carnival" enOnly={true}
  title="Aruba Carnival 2027 — Stay on the Parade Street in Oranjestad | Casa Playa 204"
  description="Aruba's Carnival season runs January–February 2027, ending with the Grand Parade through Oranjestad. Casa Playa sits on L.G. Smith Boulevard — book November–January, it sells out.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom:24px">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Carnival 2027 · sold Nov–Jan</p>
      <h1>Carnival, from a balcony on the boulevard</h1>
      <p style="max-width:62ch;font-size:1.15rem">Aruba's Carnival season runs from early January to the Grand Parade through Oranjestad in February 2027. The parade's traditional route passes along the waterfront boulevard — the street this building stands on.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container" style="padding-bottom:40px">
    <div class="arch-img" style="aspect-ratio:16/8;max-height:420px">
      <img src={img(hero.file, 800)} alt={hero.alt.en} width="800" height="533" style="height:100%" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
      <h2>What to know</h2>
      <ul class="amen-list" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:680px">
        <li>The season's climax is the Grand Parade in Oranjestad, the final Sunday before Ash Wednesday. The official 2027 route is published by the Carnival authority in January — we'll mark our front door on it the day it lands.</li>
        <li>The booking window is short: Carnival stays sell in the eight to ten weeks after the November date confirmation.</li>
        <li>Carnival-season rates apply (${(p.pricing.seasons.find(s=>s.name==='carnival')||{}).nightly}/night) and the minimum stay is {p.pricing.minNights} nights.</li>
        <li>After the parade passes, you're home — no taxi queue out of town, no road closures to beat. The fridge is yours and the balcony seats four.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:24px">Full dates and watching guide: <a href="/guide/aruba-carnival-2027-dates-parade-routes/">Aruba Carnival 2027: dates, parade routes and where to watch →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="tile-divider" role="presentation"></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:780px"><BookingWidget locale="en" property={p} mode="hero" /></div></section>
</Base>
